    "body": "> Also, come to think of it, foster parenting can also cause nested `p`s or nested `a`s, and I think AAA can also cause nested `a`s, which doesn't roundtrip.\n\n But at least, nested `a` will just bailout and will work just fine, while here things breaks completely.\n",
