    "created_at": "2016-05-19T17:38:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-19T17:38:50Z",
    "body": "> Consider `<table><form><tr><td><input>`. First pass the form is empty, child of the table, but the input is still associated with it.\n\nWe can remove association on foster parenting if `<form>` has non-descendant associated `<input>`s. Or it will not be web-compatible? As an alternative we can move such associated non-descendant inputs into `<form>`. This will brake layout but will keep form functional even after reparsing.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
